  release and identify the exact benchmark and system versions used.
title: Arabic Agent Reliability Lab
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-05
authors:
  - name: Bayanat Labs
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Bayanat-Labs/arabic-agent-reliability-lab
url: https://www.bayanatlabs.com/research/arabic-agent-reliability
abstract: >-
  A local harness for evaluating Arabic tool-using AI agents in a synthetic
  commerce sandbox. It grades tool calls and the final state, reports
  communication quality separately, and saves replayable traces and
  Reliability Passports. Methods beta.
keywords:
  - Arabic AI
  - agent evaluation
  - tool use
  - reliability
  - local AI
  - synthetic benchmark
